PASS  BBR-AUTH-1   reject BBR rollback source, baseline or finalization confusion
PASS  BOUNDARY-2   reject generic XUI authority and insecure origin TLS trust
PASS  E2E-2        reject false upstream success and BBR after main sealing
PASS  HARNESS-1    preserve canonical Tool aliases inside every isolated mutation clone
PASS  HARNESS-2    reject empty, missing or aliased trajectory and attack matrices

